      "cookedHtml": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"StriveMario\" data-display-name=\"Mario\" data-post=\"21\" data-topic=\"2246473\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://cdn.ldstatic.com/user_avatar/linux.do/strivemario/48/705803_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Mario:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>直接动手写个油猴脚本把关键词屏蔽了，眼不见心不烦。</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>油猴现成的有 直接用就可以了 或者扩展</p>",
